	(text "Highest voltage wins, no control logic: VIN_EXT 24 V > PD 15-20 V > PoE 12 V > USB 5 V.\nEach source enters through an LM74700 ideal diode: no back-feeding of a host, a PoE module or a supply.\nThe firmware identifies the active source from the four ADC inputs and derives the power budget."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7f9f5e69-7a77-55f7-b269-f4b1166f0fe3")
	)
